### Relic (Base 3,000P)
- AI-generated unique artifact with a CLEARLY DEFINED, mechanically meaningful effect. Permanent equipment (NOT consumable - no ITEM_ADD).
- Tag: `[SYSTEM|GACHA: Relic Acquired - ENGLISH (한글) | 짧은설명 | ⭐:N | 효과]` (4-pipe). 짧은설명 = 1문장 flavor (~40~60자). 효과 = mechanical one-line.
- The 한글효과설명 MUST state the effect mechanically (specific stat / situation / magnitude), not flavor-only. Lua stores it in cv_relicDetails - the AI reads it back to apply effects every relevant turn.

## 3-Tier Category Selection (MANDATORY)
Before generating, roll THREE categories independently:

카테고리_1 - Time/Origin (pick one at equal probability):
고대 / 중세 / 근대 / 현대 / 미래 / 외계 / 판타지 / 이세계

카테고리_2 - Item Type (pick one at equal probability):
무기 / 장신구 / 보석류 / 기타

카테고리_3 - Effect Type (pick one at equal probability):
스탯 강화 / 전투 보정 / 회복 강화 / 자원 효율 / 특수 발동
- 스탯 강화 (Stat Boost): Permanent stat increase. Choose one or combine:
  - ATK / DEF per Stat System tier table (1★ +2~5 … 5★ +25~40) - MUST emit stat tag.
  - LUCK (4★+ only, 보석류·운명석 콘셉트 우선) per tier (4★ +5~10, 5★ +10~20).
  - MAX_HP / MAX_MANA / MAX_HUNGER (옛 패턴): +5~25 typical, exceptional +30~50. Optional companion to stat tag.
  - Output [SYSTEM|ATTACK:+N] / [SYSTEM|DEFENSE:+N] / [SYSTEM|LUCK:+N] / [SYSTEM|MAX_HP:+N] alongside the GACHA tag. See Stat System entry for full rules.
- 전투 보정 (Combat Bonus): Persistent combat advantage applied silently every dungeon turn. Examples: "전투 시 받는 HP 피해 -10%", "치명적 성공 시 점수 +20%". MUST also emit ATK or DEF per tier (combat-related). 4★+ MAY add LUCK.
- 회복 강화 (Recovery Boost): Improved healing output. Examples: "성역의 안식 +5 HP 추가", "신성한 분수의 치유 +20%", "마나 충전 시 마나 +10 추가", "음식 사용 시 회복량 +25%".
- 자원 효율 (Resource Efficiency): Reduced costs. Examples: "스킬 마나 소비 -20%", "탐색 HP 손실 -30%", "NEW_DAY 허기 감소 -10/일", "보스전 마나 소비 -25%".
- 특수 발동 (Conditional Trigger): Auto-fires under a clear condition with a frequency cap. Examples: "HP 25% 미만일 때 1회 자동 회복 +30 HP, 던전당 1회", "던전 진입 시 1회 자동 풀회복, 던전당 1회", "하루 1회 마나 즉시 +50".

Generate a relic that fits ALL THREE categories. Example: 카테고리_1=미래 + 카테고리_2=장신구 + 카테고리_3=자원 효율 → "뉴로 코어 펜던트 - 액티브 스킬 마나 소비 -15%".

## EFFECT DESCRIPTION FORMAT (in the GACHA tag's | 한글효과설명 field)
Write the effect concretely so the AI can apply it later:
- Trigger condition (when it activates)
- Magnitude (concrete number)
- Scope (combat / dungeon / per-day / always)

### FORBIDDEN
- ❌ Flavor-only ("행운을 가져온다" / "강력한 힘이 깃든다" / etc.) - must have specific number/effect.
- ❌ `[ ]` brackets (truncates SYSTEM tag at first `]`).
- ❌ English meta-tags ("(per dungeon)", "(per turn)", "(always-on)", etc.) - use natural Korean ("던전당 1회", "매 턴", "항상 적용").

## NAMING RULES (ABSOLUTE)
The categories are CONCEPT GUIDES, not name templates. The relic NAME must be a creative, evocative proper noun - never a literal mash-up of the category words.

### FORBIDDEN naming patterns:
- ❌ Using 카테고리_1 (고대/중세/근대/현대/미래/외계/판타지/이세계) as a prefix or suffix in the relic name. Examples to AVOID: '고대의 검', '고대 룬 펜던트', '미래형 헤드셋', '판타지 반지', '외계 결정'.
- ❌ Using 카테고리_2 (무기/장신구/보석류/기타) as a literal name component. Examples to AVOID: '수정 보석류', '용맹의 무기'.
- ❌ Lazy template names like '{시대}의 {타입}' - they break immersion and signal that the gacha is just word-mixing.

### REQUIRED naming approach:
- Invent a proper noun or evocative phrase that implies the era/type through imagery, materials, mythic references, made-up names, or in-world institutions - without naming the category itself.
- Use varied naming structures: single proper nouns ('세이렌'), poetic phrases ('잊혀진 별의 노래'), mythic compounds ('뱀의 왕관'), invented brands ('브렐레의 회중시계'), descriptive titles that focus on the EFFECT rather than the era ('숨결을 삼키는 펜던트').

### GOOD examples (category leaks NOWHERE):
- 카테고리_1=고대, 카테고리_2=무기 → '녹슨 신탁의 칼날' (era implied by '녹슨'+'신탁', type implied by '칼날' - neither category word appears)
- 카테고리_1=미래, 카테고리_2=장신구 → '뉴로링크 펜던트' (era implied by '뉴로링크', type by '펜던트')
- 카테고리_1=외계, 카테고리_2=보석류 → '제논의 눈동자' (proper noun does the work)
- 카테고리_1=판타지, 카테고리_2=기타 → '용 비늘로 짠 양탄자' (era implied by '용 비늘', type by '양탄자')

### Final check before output:
Look at your proposed relic name. If you can DELETE the category-1 word (고대/미래/외계/판타지/etc.) from the name and the name still works → great, but you should not have included it in the first place. If removing the word breaks the name → REWRITE the name from scratch.

Announce to {{user}} only the relic name and description.
